  "text": "Involuntary jaw-clenching, nausea, loss of appetite.  Side effects disappeared after approximately two weeks.\nI don't feel a lot happier or free of worry, but depression and anxiety are most definitely less severe since I began this medication.\nMigraines are also less frequent (every four to five months instead of 1-2/month).\nI am definitely not disappointed with the results I've had with this medicine.\nYes, the initial side effects are quite troubling\nbut it was worth it.\n",
